            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>PalMeet 0.1.8</h2><ul>
<li>New: Import a recording (video or audio): toolbar Import… or menu bar → Import a recording…</li>
<li>Better speaker names: no more names taken from on-screen app text</li>
<li>Fix: imported/recorded meetings no longer list you as a participant when you didn't speak</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
